From: Chen Minqiang <ptpt52@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: preserve native PPE flow resources

Track IPv6 source-MAC slots across PPE banks and hold references until
hardware invalidation succeeds. Reserve physical FOE slots before writes
so timed-out transactions cannot be reused by another flow.

Keep AN7563's SDK-aligned SRAM setup and split-table RX learning in the
base driver, including its DRAM safety restriction. Leave AN758x's native
NPU, DRAM and flow-statistics initialization available to TC offload.

Signed-off-by: Chen Minqiang <ptpt52@gmail.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
@@ -2419,7 +2419,7 @@ static bool airoha_qdma_should_check_ppe
 	if (reason == AIROHA_PPE_CPU_REASON_HIT_UNBIND_RATE_REACHED)
 		return true;
 
-	if (!airoha_is(eth, airoha_en7523))
+	if (!airoha_is(eth, airoha_en7523, airoha_an7563))
 		return false;
 
 	return reason == AIROHA_PPE_CPU_REASON_HIT_UNBIND ||
@@ -4989,8 +4989,6 @@ static int airoha_set_macaddr(struct air
 	airoha_fe_wr(eth, REG_FE_MAC_LMIN(reg), lmin);
 	airoha_fe_wr(eth, REG_FE_MAC_LMAX(reg), lmax);
 
-	airoha_ppe_init_upd_mem(dev, addr);
-
 	return 0;
 }
 
